            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.annfar.2009.05.018</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The case of a 21-year old man who died due to an intracranial thrombosis just after diagnosis of Goodpasture's disease, is reported. Discussion deals with the putative mechanisms, which could be responsible for the thrombosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
